  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **It’s Got Old**: rare: 9 archived performances [3]\n- **Dirt**: rare: 10 archived performances [3]\n- **Most of What I Like**: rare: 10 archived performances [3]\n- **Slow Jam I**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 4 archived performances [3]\n- **Stressin’**: rare: 13 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2021-12-19** (recommended): soundboard; 14 songs; 100 min [1]\n- **king-gizzard-the-lizard-wizard-live-in-brisbane-21-audio**: source not stated; 14 songs; 100 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The concert was the first of five planned genre-specific nights, designated as the acoustic night [2]\n- The final scheduled metal night was cancelled due to the ongoing pandemic situation [2]\n- The venue is identified as The Princess Theatre, located in Meeanjin, Brisbane [5]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2021-12-19**: taped by Sam Joseph, Nico Wilson, Toby Brandon; source: SBD > WAV [1]. Also: Stu released audio master files and cover art for independent labels and fans to use [1]",
